From 4b00eb3cc88460c4068466bb0eddc7921c69035d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tesseract XRT port <jwkim@limagin.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:32:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 06/19] xocl/drm: set FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET on the DRM fops
 (Linux 6.12)

This is a run-time break, not a build break. Up to Linux 6.11,
drm_open_helper() set FMODE_UNSIGNED_OFFSET on every opened DRM file.
Mainline commit 641bb4394f40 ("fs: move FMODE_UNSIGNED_OFFSET to
fop_flags", v6.12) turned that into a requirement on the driver:

	if (WARN_ON_ONCE(!(filp->f_op->fop_flags & FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET)))
		return -EINVAL;

(drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c, unchanged up to v7.0). xocl uses its own
file_operations (xocl_driver_fops with .open = drm_open) instead of
DEFINE_DRM_GEM_FOPS(), so on 6.12+ every open() of the xocl render node
fails with EINVAL plus a WARN splat, and xbutil/XRT cannot reach the
user PF although the module loads and probes cleanly.

Guard: feature test "#ifdef FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET". The macro and the
drm_open_helper() check arrived in the same series, so the flag is set
exactly on the kernels that demand it, including a distribution kernel
that backports the change without a version bump (a version check would
compile there and then fail at run time). It is absent from mainline
v6.11 and from the Ubuntu 6.8.0-147 / 6.11.0-29 headers, present in
v6.12, 6.14.0-37, 6.17.0-35 and 7.0.0-x.

Equivalence: on kernels without the macro the DRM core marked the file
with FMODE_UNSIGNED_OFFSET itself; with it, the same property comes
from fop_flags, which is exactly what DEFINE_DRM_GEM_FOPS() does for
in-tree drivers. Same mmap offset handling, open() succeeds as before.

Upstream: same change as the xocl_drm.c hunk of XRT commit 6517a2a87
("Added XRT support for RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux - 10.0"), which guards it
with KERNEL_VERSION(6, 12, 0) instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SpY5QiU1d7kAe8YJM35EvA
---
 driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drm.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drm.c b/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drm.c
index 2102cf7..ecfdb93 100644
--- a/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drm.c
+++ b/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drm.c
@@ -497,6 +497,10 @@ static const struct file_operations xocl_driver_fops = {
 	.read		= drm_read,
 	.unlocked_ioctl = xocl_drm_ioctl,
 	.release	= drm_release,
+#ifdef FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET
+	/* drm_open() requires it since 6.12 (commit 641bb4394f40) */
+	.fop_flags	= FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET,
+#endif
 };
 
 static const struct vm_operations_struct xocl_vm_ops = {
